# Firmware partition images aren't shipped with the repo: modem.img alone is 270.8 MiB, over GitHub's 100 MiB hard limit.
# See radio/README.md to get them, or just run tools/fetch-firmware.sh
radio/*
!radio/README.md

# Firmware archive downloaded by tools/fetch-firmware.sh
/ovaltine-radio-*.tar.zst
